---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Return & Refund Policy — AASRA" description="Return and refund terms.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
      <h1>Return &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 16, 2026</p>

      <h3>Return window</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Returns accepted within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>.</li>
        <li>Items must be unused, unwashed, and in original packaging with all tags.</li>
        <li>We do not accept returns on final-sale or clearance items (marked on the product page).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Refund method and timeline</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Refunds are issued to the <strong>original payment method</strong> after we receive and inspect the returned item.</li>
        <li>Refunds typically appear within <strong>7–14 business days</strong>, depending on your bank or card issuer.</li>
        <li>For deposit-paid orders, the deposit is refunded per this policy once the return is inspected.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Return shipping</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Return shipping is paid by the customer unless the item is damaged, defective, or incorrect.</li>
        <li>We recommend using a trackable courier. We are not responsible for returns lost in transit.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Refund exceptions</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>No refund on balance already paid if the order is cancelled after shipping has been dispatched.</li>
        <li>Orders paid by balance that are cancelled before shipping are fully refunded.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>How to request a return</h3>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:orders@aasra.shop">orders@aasra.shop</a> with your order number and reason. We will reply with return instructions within 2 business days.</p>

      <p><strong>Business contact:</strong> orders@aasra.shop · WhatsApp: +92 300 0000000 · Karachi, Pakistan</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
